@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+'@tanstack/charts': minor
+---
+
+Accept `className` on Cartesian marks. Line, area, bar, rect, dot, hexagon,
+text, rule, tick, vector, arrow, link, band, waffle, violin, ridgeline,
+contour, density contour, and Voronoi marks append it to their base group
+class, matching polar, geo, and sunburst marks.
